<h2 id="wrapping-up">Wrapping up</h2>
<p>Code Coverage is a useful metric but should not be the end goal. Aim for a balance: maintain good coverage while ensuring effective testing. Remember that quality matters more than mere numbers. Happy testing! 🚀</p>
